d:✨ Smoother visuals when selecting and moving decrees.👀 Clearer previews showing how far a decree would reach before you move it.🔄 Better highlights and indicators when swapping positions.🎨 Improved overall readability to make eve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:29:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032442","verified_at":"2026-10-22T17:39:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993890-1846651706685113","game_id":"steam-4993890","kind":"announcement","title":"⚔️ The For Our King Demo is Out!","summary":"Hey everyone!The demo for For Our King is now available on Steam! 🎉You can defend your Keep against waves of enemies, try out different units, and mess around with Royal Decrees to see what kind of crazy combinations you can come up with.I'm really curious to see what builds people manage to put together, especially with all the different modifiers and upgrades.If you run into any bugs, find something confusing, or just want to share your thoughts and suggestions, feel free to join the Discord! ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T17:09:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993890-1842212951303057","game_id":"steam-4993890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Coming Soon!","summary":"Hello everyone,The demo build is done and in testing. I am running it through a final pass now and it goes up on the store page shortly. Version stamp is v0.33 demo.What I put in itThe first 5 levels of the first map3 Unlockable Units: Warrior, Archer and LancerA total of 39 Royal Decrees in the skill treeThe CourtAs you noticed, a lot of the game (over 80%) isn't playable in the demo yet and that is intentional. Demo will be receiving regular updates over the course of the next few weeks and on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T12:27:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303057","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4993890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4993890":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4993890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z"},"5152770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:38Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4993890","app_id":4993890,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:15Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"aeebce74fed832203462386f48fc6aab7e356cc4b10330ba2800c020d77dddb0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A medieval Tower Defense x Autobattler Roguelite. Defend your Keep across escalating waves, recruit different unit types, and cast spells from different Schools of Magic. Spend what you earn on a skill tree with over 300 upgrades, and place them on a Decree Bar with many unique modifiers and mults.","publishers":[{"name":"ZeKay Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"ZeKay"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795802400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_d